{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_execute.Policy_stamp</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_execute","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Policy_stamp","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The policy a memoised, policy-dependent result was computed under (specs/optimisation-policy.md, cache rule).</p><p>A stamp holds the <a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_policy/index.html#val-version\"><code>Sarek_policy.version</code></a> read before the policy was read and the digest of the kernel's effective policy. <a href=\"#val-current\"><code>current</code></a> is one atomic read while nothing changed; when the policy changed somewhere, it compares digests, so a grant for another kernel does not invalidate this one.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.version\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.version\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>version : <span>int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Atomic.t</span>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.digest\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.digest\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>digest : string;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-digests\"><a href=\"#val-digests\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> digests : <span>int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Atomic.t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-digests_computed\"><a href=\"#val-digests_computed\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> digests_computed : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-digest_of\"><a href=\"#val-digest_of\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> digest_of : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-make\"><a href=\"#val-make\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> make : <span><span class=\"label\">kernel</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The stamp to take BEFORE computing the result: the version is read first, so a change racing with the computation makes the stamp stale, never wrongly current.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-current\"><a href=\"#val-current\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> current : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">kernel</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>true</code> when the policy of <code>kernel</code> is the one <code>t</code> was made under.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find_current\"><a href=\"#val-find_current\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find_current : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">kernel</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">matches</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> * <span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> * <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>)</span>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The value stored under a key accepted by <code>matches</code>, if its stamp is current for <code>kernel</code>; entries are <code>(key, (value, stamp))</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-install\"><a href=\"#val-install\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> install : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">matches</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> * <span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> * <span class=\"type-var\">'c</span>)</span>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"type-var\">'c</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> * <span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'b</span> * <span class=\"type-var\">'c</span>)</span>)</span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>entries</code> with the entry for the key replaced (a stale one is dropped, not shadowed).</p></div></div>"}